{
 "id": "641a11d2-57a1-438b-b14e-5dfaf4243314",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I Became a Top Actor Just by Reading Books!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "책만 보고 탑배우!"
   },
   {
    "vi": "Trở thành diễn viên hàng đầu nhờ vào việc đọc sách"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Due to his lack of talent, Seonghyeon gave up acting and became a writer. Seonghyeon is a genius author with a natural talent for screenplays, but he still misses acting. Then one day, he got into a truck accident on set.\n\n“If I’m born again, I have to act,” he promised and closed his eyes.\n\nSeonghyeon returns 13 years back into the past to when he was 24 years old. And the method acting ability that goes into his scripts became the character itself! Okay, this life is about being reborn as a genius actor!"
  },
